Service_DoH_Alert_Empty=Configure at least one HTTPS resolver before enabling DoH.
Service_DoH_Alert_Size=The configuration is too large to save in the web interface. No changes were sent.
Service_DoH_Catalog_Unavailable=Resolver list could not be loaded. You can still enter an HTTPS URL manually.
Service_DoH_Desc=DNS-over-HTTPS protects DNS queries with HTTPS. In dnsmasq mode there is no fallback to ordinary provider DNS, so keep DoH disabled until a working resolver is configured.
